---
system: sys-09-ota-release-management
flow_id: upload-and-signing
surface: admin
spec_anchor: /software/systems/09-ota-release-management#upload-and-signing-flow-admin
actors: [AdminConsole, OtaService, S3, KMS, PostgreSQL]
apis:
  - POST /admin/ota/upload
  - POST /admin/ota/:id/stage
externals: [S3, KMS]
queues: []
failure_paths:
  - invalid_semver
  - version_already_exists
  - binary_too_large
  - elf_header_invalid
  - kms_signing_failure
  - s3_upload_failure
idempotency: firmware_releases.version unique — duplicate POST /admin/ota/upload with same version returns 409
retry: admin retries on 5xx with backoff
timeout: 60s p99 upload (MAX_BINARY_SIZE 32MB)
status: final
---
%% HAND-CURATED.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant AdminConsole
    participant OtaService
    participant S3
    participant KMS
    participant PostgreSQL

    AdminConsole->>OtaService: POST /admin/ota/upload (multipart binary, version, hw_revisions[], release_notes)
    alt invalid_semver
        OtaService-->>AdminConsole: 422 invalid_semver
    else version_already_exists
        OtaService->>PostgreSQL: SELECT firmware_releases WHERE version
        OtaService-->>AdminConsole: 409 version_already_exists
    else binary_too_large (> 32MB)
        OtaService-->>AdminConsole: 413 binary_too_large
    else elf_header_invalid
        OtaService-->>AdminConsole: 422 elf_header_invalid
    else success
        OtaService->>OtaService: compute SHA-256 of uncompressed binary
        OtaService->>OtaService: gzip compress
        OtaService->>S3: PutObject (KMS encrypted, key=firmware/{version}/binary.gz)
        alt s3_upload_failure
            S3--xOtaService: 5xx
            OtaService-->>AdminConsole: 502 s3_upload_failure
        else success
            S3-->>OtaService: ETag
        end

        OtaService->>OtaService: build manifest {version, hw_revisions, binary_url, binary_sha256, binary_size_bytes, min_battery_percent, min_rssi_dbm}
        OtaService->>KMS: Sign manifest with ECDSA_SHA_256 (OTA signing key)
        alt kms_signing_failure
            KMS--xOtaService: 5xx / throttle
            OtaService-->>AdminConsole: 503 kms_signing_failure (retry)
        else success
            KMS-->>OtaService: DER signature (base64)
        end

        OtaService->>S3: PutObject manifest.json {…, signature}
        S3-->>OtaService: ETag
        OtaService->>PostgreSQL: INSERT firmware_releases {status='draft', rollout_percentage=0, max_rollout_crash_rate=0.050, …}
        OtaService->>PostgreSQL: INSERT ota_rollout_events {event_type='created'}
        PostgreSQL-->>OtaService: release_id
        OtaService-->>AdminConsole: 201 {release_id, status='draft'}
    end

    Note over AdminConsole,PostgreSQL: separate POST /admin/ota/:id/stage verifies S3 objects and signature, transitions draft→staged · timeout 60s p99 · OTA signing key is HSM-backed annual ceremony (sys-13)
